Package: tarsila-email
Version: 2.1.0
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, fonts-roboto, xdg-utils
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Maintainer: Piano Lab Ribeirao <adm@pianolabribeirao.com.br>
Homepage: https://pianolabribeirao.com.br
Description: Tarsila Email — cliente Gmail nativo leve
 Cliente de e-mail GTK3 (sem WebKit) com sync bidirecional Gmail via
 IMAP/SMTP, cache SQLite local, notificacoes IMAP IDLE e UI estilo Gmail.
 .
 Nao depende do Claws Mail nem de qualquer cliente externo.
